e / SharePoint / other)].\n- New permission: company-wide read access (grant Viewer/read role to all accounts in your company domain).\n- Scope: apply to the specified folder and all current and future items within it (recursive to subfolders).\n- Timing/trigger: perform immediately upon receiving your CONFIRM (or wait until you tell me legal has cleared — choose below).\n- Reversibility: reversible — permissions can be restricted again later, but restoring previous granular exceptions may require manual steps.\n\nWhat I need from you before I proceed\n1. Platform (Google Drive / OneDrive / SharePoint / other)  \n2. Exact folder identifier (folder name plus path and/or folder ID or link)  \n3. Whether to include all subfolders and files (default: yes)  \n4. Whether to remove existing editors or preserve existing editor roles (default: preserve)  \n5. When to run the change:\n   - Option A — run immediately now (despite legal not yet cleared), or\n   - Option B — run only after legal clears the vendor list. If Option B, how will I know legal cleared it? (You will send confirmation here, or legal will send an email to a specific admin address — specify exact signal.)\n6. Whether to send a notification to folder collaborators after the change (yes/no).\n\nImportant limitation\n- I cannot perform the permission change directly from this chat. After you CONFIRM and provide the information above I will either:\n  - prepare and deliver the exact admin steps (copy-paste) for your admin to execute, or\n  - draft an admin request email you can send to IT (or that you can forward to legal) so they can run it, or\n  - if you prefer, provide a script/automation instructions for your environment.\n\nPlease reply with:\n- your answers to items 1–6 above, and\n- the single-word explicit confirmation: CONFIRM\n\nI will not take any action until you provide those items and that explicit CONFIRM.","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_089c3435a8ca2f4c016a9a6c85a67487d0ac6b8de305b0fd2b","ro